   "isFreePreview": true,
   "description": "Khung môn học theo syllabus FLM chính thức.",
   "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">FAP201 · Section 0 · Lesson 0.1</span>\n<h2>Course profile, as the university publishes it</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">FPGA Programming — the official numbers: credits, hours, prerequisite and the decision that issued this syllabus.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM · Syllabus ID 13853 · Decision 1402/QĐ-ĐHFPT dated 12/12/2025 · collected 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">FAP201 · Mục 0 · Bài 0.1</span>\n<h2>Hồ sơ môn học, đúng như trường công bố</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">FPGA Programming — các con số chính thức: tín chỉ, giờ học, môn tiên quyết và quyết định ban hành syllabus.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: FLM · Syllabus ID 13853 · QĐ 1402/QĐ-ĐHFPT ngày 12/12/2025 · thu ngày 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Subject code</span><span class=\"v\">FAP201</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Syllabus name</span><span class=\"v\">FPGA Programming_Lập trình FPGA</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Credits</span><span class=\"v\">3</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Degree level</span><span class=\"v\">Bachelor</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Time allocation</span><span class=\"v\">Study hour (150h) = 45h contact hours + 1h final exam + 104h self-study</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Prerequisite</span><span class=\"v\">DIC201</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Teaching method</span><span class=\"v\">Social Constructivism, In-class lecture, Inquiry-based Teaching</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Scoring scale</span><span class=\"v\">10</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Minimum average to pass</span><span class=\"v\">5</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Syllabus ID</span><span class=\"v\">13853</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Decision</span><span class=\"v\">1402/QĐ-ĐHFPT dated 12/12/2025</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Approved date</span><span class=\"v\">12/12/2025</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Sessions in the plan</span><span class=\"v\">60</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Mã môn</span><span class=\"v\">FAP201</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Tên syllabus</span><span class=\"v\">FPGA Programming_Lập trình FPGA</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Số tín chỉ</span><span class=\"v\">3</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Bậc đào tạo</span><span class=\"v\">Bachelor</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Phân bổ thời gian</span><span class=\"v\">Study hour (150h) = 45h contact hours + 1h final exam + 104h self-study</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Môn tiên quyết</span><span class=\"v\">DIC201</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Phương pháp dạy – học</span><span class=\"v\">Social Constructivism, In-class lecture, Inquiry-based Teaching</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Thang điểm</span><span class=\"v\">10</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Điểm trung bình tối thiểu để qua</span><span class=\"v\">5</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Syllabus ID</span><span class=\"v\">13853</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Quyết định ban hành</span><span class=\"v\">1402/QĐ-ĐHFPT dated 12/12/2025</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Ngày duyệt</span><span class=\"v\">12/12/2025</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Số buổi trong kế hoạch</span><span class=\"v\">60</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Description (verbatim)</h3>\n<p>- Introduction to FPGA, comparison of FPGA with other technologies such as microcontrollers and ASICs, FPGA programming languages: Verilog and VHDL, and common applications of FPGA.<br><br>- Approach models and terms such as: entity, architecture, process statements, behavioral modeling, sequential processing, parallel processing...<br><br>- Explore and utilize FPGA programming instructions: libraries, entity descriptions, architecture descriptions, data objects, data types, data conversion, operators, data attributes, signal attributes, subprograms and packages, sequential processing instructions, parallel processing instructions...<br><br>- Use hardware and software tools to execute the design process: testing (testbench), synthesis, place and route, run simulation, waveform analysis, debugging...<br><br>- Execute design projects such as: combinational logic circuits, flip-flop, counters, registers, shifters, shift registers, encoding and decoding, demultiplexers and multiplexers, memory, state machine, communication...</p>\n<h3>Note from the university</h3>\n<p>1) On-going Assessment<br><br>- 2 Progress Tests: 20%<br><br>- 6 Lab: 30%<br><br>- Interview: 10%<br><br>2) 1 Final Exam: 40%<br><br>3) Final Result: 100%<br><br>Completion Criteria:<br><br>1) Progress Tests &gt; 0<br><br>2) Lab &gt; 0<br><br>3) Final Exam Score &gt;= 4 &amp; Final Result &gt;= 5</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Mô tả môn học (nguyên văn)</h3>\n<p>- Introduction to FPGA, comparison of FPGA with other technologies such as microcontrollers and ASICs, FPGA programming languages: Verilog and VHDL, and common applications of FPGA.<br><br>- Approach models and terms such as: entity, architecture, process statements, behavioral modeling, sequential processing, parallel processing...<br><br>- Explore and utilize FPGA programming instructions: libraries, entity descriptions, architecture descriptions, data objects, data types, data conversion, operators, data attributes, signal attributes, subprograms and packages, sequential processing instructions, parallel processing instructions...<br><br>- Use hardware and software tools to execute the design process: testing (testbench), synthesis, place and route, run simulation, waveform analysis, debugging...<br><br>- Execute design projects such as: combinational logic circuits, flip-flop, counters, registers, shifters, shift registers, encoding and decoding, demultiplexers and multiplexers, memory, state machine, communication...</p>\n<h3>Ghi chú của trường</h3>\n<p>1) On-going Assessment<br><br>- 2 Progress Tests: 20%<br><br>- 6 Lab: 30%<br><br>- Interview: 10%<br><br>2) 1 Final Exam: 40%<br><br>3) Final Result: 100%<br><br>Completion Criteria:<br><br>1) Progress Tests &gt; 0<br><br>2) Lab &gt; 0<br><br>3) Final Exam Score &gt;= 4 &amp; Final Result &gt;= 5</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Everything in the tables above is copied <strong>verbatim</strong> from the university's FLM page (in English, as published) so you can check it against the copy your lecturer gives you: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13853\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13853</a> (needs your FPT login). If FLM publishes a newer syllabus, FLM wins.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Mọi thứ trong các bảng trên được chép <strong>nguyên văn</strong> từ trang FLM của trường (bằng tiếng Anh, đúng như trường công bố) để bạn đối chiếu với bản giảng viên phát: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13853\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13853</a> (cần đăng nhập tài khoản FPT). Nếu FLM công bố bản syllabus mới hơn thì theo FLM.</div></div>"
